# Yersinia pestis MLVA-25 of Le Fleche et al. 2001, the 25 loci polymorphic among Y. pestis that
# Pourcel et al. 2004 used, in the order of the source table. The locus ids are the short ms names;
# the label column of markers.tsv keeps the full locus name, which also gives the position of the
# locus in the CO92 chromosome in kb.
#
# The expected size is a search window, not a reference product. It spans the published size range,
# extended to include the product measured in CO92, less 50 bp at the low end and plus 200 bp at the
# high end. It only bounds the search and does not affect allele calls.
